  "id": "RMCIDSWEEP00001",
  "name": "[RMMKT] RM \u00b7 7 Content ID sweep",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RM \u00b7 7 \u2014 Content ID sweep\n\n**Starts:** daily 07:20, or *Run on demand*.\n\nUploads go up **private with a scheduled public time**, which leaves a window to catch a problem\nbefore anyone sees it. This checks every scheduled-but-unpublished video for a Content ID block and\nalerts with the title, the regions and the deadline.\n\nWhy it exists: one claimed trailer (Neagley, 25 Sep) blocked an entire 5-film countdown in 249\nregions, and YouTube says nothing \u2014 the video simply becomes invisible.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "overview-note",
      "name": "What this workflow does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cron",
      "name": "Daily 07:20",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "20 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "manual",
      "name": "Run on demand",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sweep",
      "name": "Gateway: check Content ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8787/youtube/check-blocks",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Gateway-Token",
              "value": "={{ $env.RM_GATEWAY_TOKEN }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 07:20": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gateway: check Content ID",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run on demand": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gateway: check Content ID",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
